# 信息展示UI通用模式规范

## 概述

本规范基于项目中抽屉组件和详情页面的实际实现，定义了信息展示类UI组件的标准布局、样式和交互模式。适用于抽屉、详情页、信息卡片等场景。

## 通用布局规范

### 1. 双栏布局结构

信息展示页面统一采用左右双栏布局，比例根据内容需要调整：

```vue
<div class="info-container">
  <div class="container-left">
    <!-- 主要信息展示区域 -->
  </div>
  <div class="container-right">
    <!-- 辅助信息和操作区域 -->
  </div>
</div>
```

#### 抽屉组件布局（45:55）
```scss
.body-content {
  display: flex;

  .left-section {
    width: 45%;
  }

  .right-section {
    width: 55%;
  }
}
```

#### 详情页面布局（50:50）
```scss
.detail-container {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;

  .container-left {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .container-right {
    flex: 1;
  }
}
```

## 信息项展示规范

### 1. 标准信息项结构

所有信息展示统一使用标签-值模式：

```vue
<div class="info-item">
  <div class="item-label">{{ label }}</div>
  <div class="item-value">{{ value }}</div>
</div>
```

### 2. 样式规范

#### 抽屉组件信息项样式
```scss
.info-item {
  display: flex;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 22px;
  align-items: left;
  margin-bottom: 12px;

  .left-label {
    width: 102px;
    color: #6B7280;
    margin-right: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .right-value {
    color: #374151;
    margin-right: 8px;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
}
```

#### 详情页面信息项样式
```scss
.content-item {
  display: flex;
  width: 100%;
  line-height: 20px;
  margin: 20px 0;

  .item-label {
    width: 86px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #6B7280;
  }

  .item-value {
    color: #374151;
    margin-left: 12px;
    width: calc(100% - 108px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
}
```

## 区块标题规范

### 1. 统一区块标题样式

```vue
<div class="section-title">
  {{ title }}
  <span class="link-text" @click="handleAction">{{ linkText }}</span>
</div>
```

```scss
.section-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #4B5563;
  margin: 20px 0 16px;
  padding-left: 10px;
  line-height: 22px;
  border-left: 2px solid #416FFC;
}

.link-text {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #0071F3;
  margin-left: 12px;
  font-weight: 400;
  cursor: pointer;

  &:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
}
```

### 2. 页面级标题样式

```scss
.title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #374151;
  line-height: 54px;
  height: 54px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #F8FAFE;
}
```

## 状态标签规范

### 1. 通用状态标签

```vue
<span class="status-badge" :class="statusClass">
  {{ statusText }}
</span>
```

```scss
.status-badge {
  margin-left: 8px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 400;
}

// 状态颜色定义
.status-normal, .normal {
  color: #10B981;
  background: #E8F8F3;
}

.status-error, .serious {
  color: #EF4444;
  background: #FEEDED;
}

.status-warning, .warning {
  color: #F59E0B;
  background: #FEF6D5;
}
```

### 2. 相似度/得分显示

```vue
<span class="similarity" :class="score > 80 ? 'high' : 'low'">
  {{ score }}%
</span>
```

```scss
.similarity {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-left: 16px;
}

.high {
  color: #10B981;
}

.low {
  color: #EF4444;
}
```

## 图片展示规范

### 1. 图片网格布局

```vue
<div class="photo-container">
  <div class="photo-item" v-for="(photo, index) in photos" :key="index">
    <div class="photo-placeholder">
      <viewer v-if="photo.src">
        <img class="photo-img" :src="photo.src" alt="">
      </viewer>
      <div v-else class="no-image">暂无图片</div>
      <div class="download-btn" @click="downloadImage(photo.src)">
        <img class="btn-download" src="@/assets/audit/download.png" alt="">
        下载图片
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-label">{{ photo.label }}</div>
  </div>
</div>
```

### 2. 图片样式规范

```scss
.photo-container {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  width: 100%;
}

.photo-item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  text-align: center;
}

.photo-placeholder {
  width: 90px;
  height: 90px;
  background-color: #F3F4F6;
  border-radius: 6px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
}

.photo-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 6px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.no-image {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #4B5563;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.download-btn {
  font-size: 12px;
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  height: 24px;
  line-height: 24px;
  font-weight: 400;
  border-radius: 0px 0px 6px 6px;
  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  display: flex;
  cursor: pointer;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.photo-label {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #4B5563;
  line-height: 22px;
  margin-top: 4px;
}
```

## 表单操作规范

### 1. 表单样式统一

```scss
::v-deep .el-form-item__label {
  color: #6B7280;
  font-weight: 400;
}

::v-deep .el-select {
  width: 90%;
}

::v-deep .el-textarea {
  width: 90%;
}

// 单选按钮样式
/deep/ .el-radio__input.is-checked .el-radio__inner {
  border-color: #416FFC;
  background: #416FFC;
}

/deep/ .el-radio__input.is-checked+.el-radio__label {
  color: #416FFC;
}
```

### 2. 操作按钮区域

```vue
<div class="operation-buttons">
  <el-button type="primary" size="medium" @click="handleConfirm">提交</el-button>
  <el-button size="medium" @click="handleCancel">取消</el-button>
</div>
```

